      "message": "fix(drilling): a mill names radial holes in skipped, never in cross\n\nDetect holes on a machine of kind Mill no longer stores the radial\nholes it finds in the Drill op's cross list. That list is live-tooling\nwork for a turret, Generate refuses it on a mill, and edit_operation\ncannot clear it. Each radial hole is now named in skipped, with its\nsize, origin and direction. The Z holes stay and generate. When no Z\nhole remains, Detect holes refuses and names each radial hole.\n\nFixes #3448\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
